{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22481","headline":"委顺 · 白居易","name":"委顺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"山城虽荒芜，竹树有嘉色。\n郡俸诚不多，亦足充衣食。\n外累由心起，心宁累自息。\n尚欲忘家乡，谁能算官职。\n宜怀齐远近，委顺随南北。\n归去诚可怜，天涯住亦得。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22481.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22481","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}